OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers warned of November rail
OL,4,Adisruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers are being urged to plan
OL,7,Fahead for their journeys this November
OL,8,Fwhile essential upgrades are made to
OL,9,Fthe rail network.
OL,11,FParts of the Great Eastern Main Line in
OL,12,FEssex and Suffolk will be affected, as
OL,13,Fwell as the branches to Harwich,
OL,14,FBraintree and Sudbury.
OL,16,FThe work - to improve reliability and
OL,17,Fprepare for major track renewals over
OL,18,FChristmas - will also affect the lines
OL,19,Fto Southend Victoria and Southminster.
OL,21,FIt means buses will replace trains over
OL,22,Fthe course of three weekends.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
